 "intro_zh": "罗浮山素有“岭南第一山”之称，是中国道教十大名山之一。罗浮山自然景观众多，融自然与人文景观于一体，拥有山、水、泉、瀑、池、洞、观、寺、塔、林等景观，具有“天际一轴线，仙凡两重天”“一山分四季，十里不同温”的自然特征。",
 "intro_en": "Luofu Mountain is known as the \"No. 1 Mountain in Lingnan\" and is one of the ten famous Taoist mountains in China. Luofu Mountain has many natural landscapes, integrating natural and cultural landscapes. It has mountains, water, springs, waterfalls, pools, caves, temples, pagodas, forests and other landscapes. It has the natural characteristics of \"one axis of the sky, two heavens of immortality\" and \"one mountain is divided into four seasons, and the temperature is different for ten miles\".",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
